/// Upper-Body Hypertrophy, 3 days a week. Arms priority.
/// Paste this whole file into Liftosaur: Programs -> New program -> switch to text (full) mode.
/// Starting weights assume ~75-85 kg with no lifting background. Adjust in week 1.
/// Double progression is automatic: when every set hits the prescribed reps, the app adds
/// one rep next session, up to the top of the range, then adds weight and drops back to the bottom.
/// Weeks 1-3: stop 3-4 reps short of failure. From week 4: 1-2 reps short. Last arm set can go to failure.

# Week 1

## Day A

// Handles at mid-chest height. Full stretch at the back, elbows about 45 degrees from the body.
Chest Press, Leverage Machine / 3x6 35kg 120s / warmup: 1x8 50%, 1x4 75% / progress: dp(2.5kg, 6, 10)

// Slight lean back, pull the bar to the upper chest, drive elbows down. Full stretch at the top.
Lat Pulldown, Cable / 3x8 40kg 120s / warmup: 1x6 60% / progress: dp(2.5kg, 8, 12)

// Let the shoulder blades reach forward at the start, then pull to the lower ribs.
Seated Row, Cable / 3x8 40kg 120s / warmup: none / progress: dp(2.5kg, 8, 12)

// Bench at about 45 degrees, arms hanging straight down and slightly back. Curl without moving the upper arm.
Incline Curl, Dumbbell / 4x8 8kg 45s / warmup: none / superset: A / progress: dp(2kg, 8, 12)

// Overhead, rope. Face away from the stack, elbows by the ears, deep stretch behind the head each rep.
overhead: Triceps Extension, Cable / 4x10 25kg 45s / warmup: none / superset: A / progress: dp(2.5kg, 10, 15)

// Slight forward lean, lead with the elbows, stop at shoulder height. Light weight, no swinging.
Lateral Raise, Dumbbell / 3x12 6kg 60s / warmup: none / progress: dp(1kg, 12, 15)

// Heavy dumbbells at the sides. Full stretch at the bottom, shrug straight up, hold 1 second at the top.
Shrug, Dumbbell / 3x10 22kg 60s / warmup: none / progress: dp(2kg, 10, 15)

// Feet mid-platform, shoulder width. As deep as you can with heels down. Weight is plates only, not the sled.
Hack Squat, Leverage Machine / 3x8 50kg 120s / warmup: 1x6 50% / progress: dp(10kg, 8, 12)

## Day B

// 30 degree bench. Deep stretch at upper-chest level, elbows about 45 degrees out. Press up and slightly in.
Incline Bench Press, Dumbbell / 3x6 12kg 120s / warmup: 1x8 50%, 1x4 75% / progress: dp(2kg, 6, 10)

// Chest glued to the pad. Pull elbows back and squeeze the shoulder blades together.
Chest-Supported Row, Leverage Machine / 3x8 35kg 120s / warmup: 1x6 60% / progress: dp(2.5kg, 8, 12)

// Start with handles at about chin height. Press up without flaring the ribs.
Shoulder Press, Leverage Machine / 3x8 25kg 120s / warmup: none / progress: dp(2.5kg, 8, 12)

// Armpits on top of the pad. Lower almost to straight arms, then curl. No shoulder movement. Weight includes the bar (about 8 kg).
Preacher Curl, EZ Bar / 4x8 15kg 45s / warmup: none / superset: B / progress: dp(2.5kg, 8, 12)

// Elbows pinned to the sides. Push to lockout, let the forearms come up past 90 degrees on the way back.
Triceps Pushdown, Cable / 4x10 25kg 45s / warmup: none / superset: B / progress: dp(2.5kg, 10, 15)

// Handles at chest height. Open wide to a stretch, then bring the arms together with a slight elbow bend.
Pec Deck, Leverage Machine / 2x10 35kg 60s / warmup: none / progress: dp(2.5kg, 10, 15)

// Pad just above the heels. Curl all the way down and control the return.
Seated Leg Curl, Leverage Machine / 3x8 35kg 120s / warmup: 1x6 60% / progress: dp(5kg, 8, 12)

## Day C

// Shoulder blades back and down. Deep stretch beside the chest, press up and slightly in.
Bench Press, Dumbbell / 3x8 14kg 120s / warmup: 1x8 50%, 1x4 75% / progress: dp(2kg, 8, 12)

// Underhand grip, palms facing you, shoulder width. Weight here is the ASSISTANCE. Lower assistance = harder. Full hang, chin over the bar.
Chin Up, Leverage Machine / 3x6 40kg 120s / warmup: 1x5 55kg / progress: custom() {~
  if (completedReps >= reps) {
    if (reps[1] < 10) {
      reps += 1
    } else {
      reps = 6
      weights -= 2.5kg
    }
  }
~}

// Hand and knee on the bench. Let the dumbbell hang to a stretch, then row to the hip. No twisting.
Bent Over One Arm Row, Dumbbell / 3x8 16kg 120s / warmup: none / progress: dp(2kg, 8, 12)

// Bayesian curl. Low pulley behind you, step forward so the arm is stretched behind the torso. Curl with the upper arm fixed. One arm at a time.
Bicep Curl, Cable / 4x8 12.5kg 45s / warmup: none / superset: C / progress: dp(2.5kg, 8, 12)

// Both hands under one dumbbell, elbows pointing forward, lower behind the head to a deep stretch.
db: Triceps Extension, Dumbbell / 4x10 16kg 45s / warmup: none / superset: C / progress: dp(2kg, 10, 15)

// Chest on the pad, arms slightly bent, sweep the handles back until the arms are in line with the shoulders.
Reverse Fly, Leverage Machine / 3x12 30kg 60s / warmup: none / progress: dp(2.5kg, 12, 15)

// Full stretch at the bottom, shrug straight up, hold 1 second at the top. No rolling.
Shrug, Dumbbell / ...Shrug[1]

// Feet shoulder width, lower until the thighs nearly touch the torso. Keep the lower back on the pad. Plates only, not the sled.
Leg Press, Leverage Machine / 3x10 80kg 120s / warmup: 1x8 50% / progress: dp(10kg, 10, 15)
